Sex Ratio
Sex ratio has remained constant at 107 over the past 11 years as presented in Table 1.6. There were obvious
differences by sector with sex ratio in the rural sector lower at 107 than in the urban sector with 111 as shown
in Table 1.7.
Sex ratio also varied from a high of 114 in NCD to a low of 100 in ESP indicating approximately equal numbers
